    "text": "By Editorial ,\n18 hours ago Last month I visited a gun show at the Erie County Fairgrounds where I was appalled to see Nazi and Confederate army paraphernalia. For context I am a Vietnam Veteran, an independent voter and a responsible gun owner who grew up in a time where hunting for our food was necessary to our survival. Read full article",
